{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Reaper Harvest Time preserves Soul Infusion at 50%, not always",
  "contract": [
    "Harvest Time 803995 promises abilities requiring Soul Infusion have a 50% chance to not consume the",
    "effect. AscensionCompat.cpp HarvestTimePreserves previously returned true unconditionally whenever the",
    "aura was present, so Soul Infusion Reaped Soul Remover 561290 was never cast while Harvest Time was",
    "active. Soulslam 504014 has CasterAuraSpell 803031 (Soul Infusion) and is not in",
    "REAPER_ALL_SOUL_CONSUMERS, so it exercises the requiresSoulInfusion/HarvestTimePreserves path.",
    "Soulslam is a level-20 class kit spell (AscensionCustomClassData.h) gated by CoA.AutoProgression",
    "(off by default per coa.conf.dist), so it must be learned explicitly rather than assumed from the",
    "character's level; a prior run recorded spell_active=false on the bare cast, which is the harness's",
    "cast-the-owned-rank wall (the spell was simply never learned), not a Soulslam-specific defect.",
    "Across 16 independent casts with Soul Infusion re-applied before each one, a 50% preserve chance",
    "(read from Harvest Time's own DBC effect 1, EffectBasePoints -51) makes at least one consumption and",
    "at least one preservation overwhelmingly likely (~2^-15 to fail either bound by chance); the pre-fix",
    "code always preserves (0 consumptions), which the min bound rejects."
  ],
